
@real = http://localhost:3000

# Seeded accounts (sql/seed.sql). Fill in the passwords you seeded with.
@devUser   = dev
@devPass   = dev123
@adminUser = admin
@adminPass = admin123
@userUser  = baker
@userPass  = baker123


# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
#  TC02 — App connects via pool; controller joins   [MANUAL / inspection]
#  Expected: app uses a connection pool; a controller JOINs across tables.
#  Check: .env (DB_HOST/USER/PASS/NAME), config/db.js (mysql2 createPool),
#         controllers/batch.controller.js getAll — JOINs batch + starter + user.
#  The request below is the live proof that the join works (run TC03-login first):
# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

### TC02 (live) login as admin, then read joined batch list -> rows include starter_name & baked_by
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{real}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{adminUser}}", "password": "{{adminPass}}" }

###
GET {{real}}/batches


# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
#  TC03 — CRUD Create (Admin)   Expected: 201; row appears in list
#  (run the admin login just above first)
# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

### TC03 create an ingredient -> 201 { id, name, unit, reorder }
# @name createIngredient
POST {{real}}/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Rye Flour", "unit": "g", "reorder": 1000 }

### TC03 verify it is in the list -> find "Test Rye Flour"
GET {{real}}/ingredients


# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
#  TC04 — CRUD Read (User)   Expected: list + detail load with correct data
# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

### TC04a login as USER (baker)
POST {{real}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{userUser}}", "password": "{{userPass}}" }

### TC04b read list -> 200 array
GET {{real}}/ingredients

### TC04c read one -> 200 single object (use an id you saw in TC03/TC04b)
GET {{real}}/ingredients/1


# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
#  TC05 — CRUD Update (Admin)   Expected: reorder changes (3 -> 5 style)
