# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

### TC05a login as admin
POST {{real}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{adminUser}}", "password": "{{adminPass}}" }

### TC05b read first to look at id 1
GET {{real}}/ingredients/1

### TC05c update ingredient 1 -> 200 { updated: 1 }  (change name/unit/reorder)
PUT {{real}}/ingredients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Unbleached Bread Flour", "unit": "g", "reorder": 5000 }

### TC05d read back to confirm the new value
GET {{real}}/ingredients/1


# ████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
